      "value": "I also want to quickly clarify as discussion with some people around the community has made me realize a potential confusion:\n\nThis is NOT trying to increase the max amount of audio sources in the performance rating; this is requesting we have a marginal increase in the amount of actively playing audio sources to allow more dynamic use of them",
