      "value": "@{5e89d0822aedbc56a3155d12|full_name} So guns are louder than that and you can hear them at the same volume up to at least 20m. And as someone who does rp on this game having gun shots that can be heard at least semi realistically really does help. Also having extra sound effects is still good for more than just distant audio, it'd be really good for reloading audio, footstep sounds, grenades, and all other kinds of things that would be nice to have for the roleplay side of the community",
