      "value": "@{69e6d0b865c4cf9dd91e020d|full_name} Except my point was you can drive distance audio FX on a shared audio source via animation, and use the contact receiver to tell if the recipient should be receiving the near/medium SFX clip and respective audio settings, so there's no reason to have two of those playing simultaneously when at least one won't be heard anyway (and specifically isn't designed to be).",
